# fc-media-suite

When the user mentions `/watch`, `/cam`, `/clock`, `/map`, `/webgrid`, `/lens`, `/cast`, `/preserve`, live demux, half-block video, Brick backup, or media suite:

- Run **`fcs <cmd> [args]`** via the terminal tool (universal CLI).
- Do not reimplement yt-dlp/ffmpeg players in chat.
- Agent-safe: `fcs watch popout …`, `fcs clock --once`, `fcs map popout …`.
- Install if missing: `bash ~/Projects/grok-build/plugins/fc-media-suite/scripts/fcs install`
- Soft Path owns ports 8765/8766 — do not bind them.
